				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-29T09:18:49" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ただいま　[Digit:4digits Idx="0" ]連勝！▼
次は　[Digit:1digit Idx="1" ]両目と　なります
対戦を　続けますか？</Text>
